<title>BELGIUM: Luxair says Strasbourg flight on despite strike.</title>
<headline>Luxair says Strasbourg flight on despite strike.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Luxembourg airline Luxair said on Wednesday that, contrary to a statement earlier this week, its flight to Vienna via Strasbourg would not be affected by France's public sector workers strike on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;Luxair is pleased to announce the French transport authorities...have included (the flight) in the minimum service which will be operated on October 17 due to the national strike,&quot; Luxair said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
